# cards: a card moves a stat one stage at most (docs/plan-cards.md 3.3). Lucia wears Quetzalcoatl (ATK down, all
# enemies) at 2000 points; the enemies' HP is pinned so the battle lasts. She uses it in rounds 1 and 2: battler 9's
# ATK stage (its stat record 0x0228EC2C + 0x40) goes to -1 and stays there (vanilla: -2); points 2000 -> 1800.
include party2_strong
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
poke u16 0x020B48AC 2000
poke u16 0x020B46FE 236
pin u32 0x0228ea24 500
pin u32 0x0228ea90 500
pin u32 0x0228eafc 500
pin u32 0x0228ebd4 500
pin u32 0x0228ec40 500
pin u32 0x0228ecac 500
wait 270
watch u16 0x0228EC6C atk_stage9
watch u16 0x020B48AC points
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 1500
shot cr_r2_start
press A 8
wait 60
shot cr_r2_a1
press A 8
wait 60
shot cr_r2_a2
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
shot cr_r2_list
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 700
peek u16 0x0228EC6C atk_stage9_end
